  "title": "AXIL Brands Launches X30i Filtered Earplug Bundle Pack on Costco.com",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, September 25, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AXIL Brands, Inc. (“AXIL” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: AXIL), an emerging global consumer products company specializing in AXIL® hearing protection and enhancement products and Reviv3® hair and skin care products, announces that its advanced X30i filtered earplugs are now available in a convenient two-pack bundle on Costco.com.",
